cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use KVBench, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "KVBench: Bridging Offline Fidelity and Online Inference Evaluation for KV Cache Compression in Small Language Models"
abstract: >-
  KVBench is a reproducible benchmarking framework for KV-cache compression on
  small language models. It is implemented as the KV Cache Interception and
  Transformation Engine: a unified interception stack, plug-in compressors, and
  dual offline (Section A) / online (Section B) evaluation metrics. Research
  manuscript in preparation.
